[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9900.389, "timestamp": "02:45:00", "text": "而这一点很快就澄清了，即将发生跳跃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9902.469, "timestamp": "02:45:02", "text": "关闭或类似情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9904.469, "timestamp": "02:45:04", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9912.07, "timestamp": "02:45:12", "text": "我们要上去了。这里空空如也。就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9915.75, "timestamp": "02:45:15", "text": "没有。是的。在这里可以找到任何东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9918.95, "timestamp": "02:45:18", "text": "然后，是的。这好像也不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9921.429, "timestamp": "02:45:21", "text": "尚未使用。想象一下它能有多大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9923.91, "timestamp": "02:45:23", "text": "到过。还有这个。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9928.87, "timestamp": "02:45:28", "text": "这里景色美极了。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9931.269, "timestamp": "02:45:31", "text": "以及各种下界和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9933.91, "timestamp": "02:45:33", "text": "一切。它叫下界吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9938.15, "timestamp": "02:45:38", "text": "是的。来自下界的植物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9940.15, "timestamp": "02:45:40", "text": "下界。是的。好的。我们下去吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9942.389, "timestamp": "02:45:42", "text": "没什么。没有。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9944.309, "timestamp": "02:45:44", "text": "无事可做。就像我们甚至都没有一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9947.51, "timestamp": "02:45:47", "text": "利用鞘翅跳下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9958.15, "timestamp": "02:45:58", "text": "你如何下去？好的。呃，换挡LC。"}]